+// the float constants come from two uniform buffers (vertex binding 0, pixel binding 1, as the
+// arrays g_DkVertexConstants / g_DkPixelConstants of shader_common.h), the shared words from
+// a third (binding 2), and each fetch slot is one texture at binding = slot with its sampler
